graph TD
    START([What am I building?])

    Q1{Is this a new page
    or full navigation?}

    FULL["Full Page Load
    Regular a href or form submit
    Server returns complete HTML page
    Examples: login page, landing page,
    navigation between sections"]

    Q2{Can the server
    render the response
    as an HTML fragment?}

    FETCH_EXT["Manual fetch to external API
    Third-party APIs return JSON only
    Examples: Google Maps API,
    payment gateway PayMongo,
    weather data from PAGASA"]

    Q3{Do I need complex
    client-side state?
    sorting, filtering,
    charts/graphs?}

    FETCH_STATE["Manual fetch with state
    Client manages sort order, filters,
    or renders charts from data
    Examples: dashboard with Chart.js,
    sortable/filterable data table,
    real-time search with debounce"]

    HTMX["htmx: hx-get / hx-post
    Server renders HTML, client swaps it
    Examples: province dropdown loads cities,
    barangay list click to view profile,
    inline form submit and re-render,
    load more pagination button"]

    START --> Q1
    Q1 -->|Yes| FULL
    Q1 -->|No| Q2
    Q2 -->|No| FETCH_EXT
    Q2 -->|Yes| Q3
    Q3 -->|Yes| FETCH_STATE
    Q3 -->|No| HTMX

    style FULL fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#0d47a1
    style HTMX fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b5e20
    style FETCH_EXT fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825,color:#e65100
    style FETCH_STATE fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825,color:#e65100
    style START fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2
    style Q1 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#616161
    style Q2 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#616161
    style Q3 fill:#ffffff,stroke:#616161
